 - Add `ByteSlice` and `ByteSliceValue` functions for new `BYTESLICE` attribute type in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute`. (#7948)
 
+### Changed
+
+- `ErrorType` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.40.0` now unwraps errors created by `fmt.Errorf` with `%w` and reports the type of the first non-wrapping error in the chain instead of `*fmt.wrapError`. (#6904)
+- The `exception.type` attribute emitted by `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/log` now unwraps errors created by `fmt.Errorf` with `%w` and reports the type of the first non-wrapping error in the chain instead of `*fmt.wrapError`. (#6904)
